0345161273_n.png", "id": "1895053937782800", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001681_1895053941116133_1990099383425292176_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5dHmtGer5IEQ7kNvwGSrQhS&_nc_oc=AdlzfzpI6v7PiUhdkoeS-NPUfxAIE4_AUAL85fUHuHk0IULgyfyTk1AxjaIlnbxk4js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsFI-QB1wmS9ryWMpMnk5GIT1h0FR6r4IvfAgsPlznUAw&oe=69A6D608"}, "display_name": "Trim On", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Trim On \u00e4r ett nytt s\u00e4tt att l\u00e4ra sig segla, och g\u00f6r segling mer tillg\u00e4nglig f\u00f6r alla.\n\nI denna VR upplevelse kommer du att l\u00e4ra dig grunderna i segling, inklusive hur man man\u00f6vrerar b\u00e5ten i olika vind- och v\u00e4derf\u00f6rh\u00e5llanden. Du f\u00e5r ocks\u00e5 l\u00e4ra dig att trimma b\u00e5ten f\u00f6r olika vindhastigheter och t\u00e4vla runt en bana.", "short_description": "V\u00e4lkommen till Trim On, en virtuell seglarskola med v\u00e4rldsm\u00e4staren Lars Linger."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.trim-on.com/Privacy-Policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Trim On", "support_website_url": "https://www.trim-on.com/", "website_url": "https://www.trim-on.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "sv"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1741861632890999"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"ur